# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is git-ignored; this file is not.
#
# Clerk publishable key. Leave empty to run the fully local, ungated build:
# the planner works offline and the auth pages report that no identity provider
# is configured. Set it to enable accounts, Google sign-in, and tier gating.
#
# Publishable keys (pk_test_... / pk_live_...) are meant to be public and are
# safe to inline in client JavaScript. Never put a Clerk secret key (sk_...) in
# a VITE_ variable — Vite inlines every VITE_* value into the shipped bundle.
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
